              "quote": "Even after the passing of the Third Reform Act in 1884, only 60% of male householders over the age of 21 had the vote."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "issue-03",
          "factId": "f4",
          "severity": "major",
          "verdict": "imprecise",
          "claim": "要求把“人”改为“男人和女人”",
          "problem": "密尔修正案是把法案中的“man”改为“person”，即用中性词覆盖两性，并非写成“男人和女人”；1867年5月20日表决以73票对196票被否决。",
          "correction": "1866年，一批妇女向议会递交请愿书；1867年，议员约翰·斯图尔特·密尔提出修正案，要求把法案中的“man”改为“person”，以73票对196票被否决。此后妇女参政进入组织化阶段。",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "title": "Presenting the 1866 petition (UK Parliament)",
              "url": "https://www.parliament.uk/about/living-heritage/transformingsociety/electionsvoting/womenvote/parliamentary-collections/1866-suffrage-petition/presenting-the-petition/",
              "quote": "On 20 May 1867 Mill tried to amend the Second Reform Bill to replace the word ‘man' with ‘person'... The division was lost by 73 votes to 196"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "issue-04",
          "factId": "f9",
          "severity": "major",
          "verdict": "imprecise",
          "claim": "同时把男性投票年龄降到21岁",
          "problem": "1918年以前，符合财产资格的男子本就在21岁取得投票权；1918年法案废除的是几乎全部男性财产资格，把选举权给到所有21岁以上男子，并未把年龄从更高值降下来。",
          "correction": "1918年的《人民代表法》废除男性选举的财产资格，年满21岁的男子均可投票；同时给30岁以上、拥有财产或大学学历的妇女投票权。1928年，妇女投票年龄也降到21岁。",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "title": "Representation of the People Act 1918 (UK Parliament)",
              "url": "https://www.parliament.uk/about/living-heritage/transformingsociety/parliament-and-the-first-world-war/legislation-and-acts-of-war/acts-of-war---representation-of-the-people-act-1918--/",
              "quote": "For the first time, almost all property qualifications needed for men to vote were abolished."
            }
          ]
        }
